hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"133","[AI-translation] Haddasana Yusuf bin 'Isa, qala: Haddasana Waki', qala: Haddasana Isra'il, 'an Simak bin Harb, 'an Jabir bin Samura, qala: Maine Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko takiye par tikiya hue dekha."
"134","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Abdullah bin 'Abdir-Rahman, qala: Haddasana 'Amr bin 'Asim, qala: Haddasana Hammad bin Salama, 'an Humaid, 'an Anas: Ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam bemar the, pas Usama bin Zaid ka sahara liye nikle, aur un par Qitri libas tha jise unhone aar-paar bandha hua tha, phir unki namaz padhayi."
"135","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Abdullah bin 'Abdir-Rahman, qala: Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-Mubarak, qala: Haddasana 'Ata bin Muslim Al-Khaffaf Al-Halabi, qala: Haddasana Ja'far bin Burqan, 'an 'Ata bin Abi Rabah, 'an Al-Fadl bin 'Abbas, qala: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ke paas unki us bemari mein dakhil hua jis mein unki wafat hui, aur unke sar par zardi rang ki patti bandhi hui thi. Maine unhe salam kiya, to unhon ne farmaya: Aye Fadl! Maine kaha: Labbaik ya Rasoolallah! Unhon ne farmaya: Mere sar ko is patti se jor do. Qala: Maine kar diya. Phir woh baithe aur apna haath mere kandhe par rakha, phir khare hue aur masjid mein dakhil hue."
"136","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: Haddasana 'Abdur-Rahman bin Mahdi, 'an Sufyan, 'an Sa'd bin Ibrahim, 'an Ka'b bin Malik ke ek bete se, unke ab se: Ke Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam teen ungliyan chaate the."
"137","[AI-translation] Haddasana Al-Hasan bin 'Ali Al-Khallal, qala: Haddasana 'Affan, qala: Haddasana Hammad bin Salama, 'an Thabit, 'an Anas, qala: Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam jab koi khana khate to apni teen ungliyan chaate."
